---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { repoUrl } from '../data'

const archiveUrl = process.env.ARCHIVE_URL || 'https://old.filecoindataportal.xyz'
---

<Layout title="About" description="Who maintains the Filecoin Data Portal, how it is funded and updated, and the terms for its code and datasets.">
  <header class="page-head compact">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>The Filecoin Data Portal is an open, local-friendly data platform that unifies Filecoin data from on-chain and off-chain sources into free daily datasets. Pipelines, transformations, and this site are maintained in the <a href={repoUrl}>project repository</a>.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="maintainer">
    <h2 id="maintainer">Who is behind it</h2>
    <p>The project is maintained by <a href="https://davidgasquez.com/">David Gasquez</a>, thanks to <a href="https://protocol.ai/blog/pl-past-present-future/">Protocol Labs blue funds</a> and <a href="https://www.fil-retropgf.io/">Filecoin Retroactive Public Goods Funding</a> programs.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="updates">
    <h2 id="updates">Updates</h2>
    <p>Datasets rebuild once a day in GitHub Actions; <a href={`${repoUrl}/actions`}>every run and its logs</a> are public. Daily tables end at UTC yesterday at the latest, and sources update on different schedules. Get the files from the <a href="/datasets">dataset catalog</a> or see the <a href="/docs">docs</a>. Need something else? <a href={`${repoUrl}/issues/new`}>Open an issue</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="usage">
    <h2 id="usage">Who uses it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/numbers">Filecoin in numbers</a>, on this site.</li>
      <li><a href="https://www.reppo.ai/models">Reppo storage provider reputation models</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="terms">
    <h2 id="terms">License and disclaimer</h2>
    <p>The datasets are free to use without restriction, released into the public domain under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/public-domain/cc0/">CC0</a>. The code that builds them and this site is under the <a href={`${repoUrl}/blob/main/LICENSE`}>MIT license</a>.</p>
    <p>Everything is provided as is, without warranties or guarantees of any kind, expressed or implied. You use the datasets at your own risk.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="previous">
    <h2 id="previous">Previous site</h2>
    <p>The earlier version of this site is kept as a frozen archive at <a href={archiveUrl}>{archiveUrl.replace(/^https?:\/\//, '')}</a>. It is no longer updated; the archive shows the dates its pages cover. Current numbers and datasets are here.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
